A||N||71||87ECO5||2002 PFF Calendar - Ready to take Orders!!!||||6||
Z||000000||87ECO5||12-04-2001||09:23 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/004357.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/004357.html</A> <P>We are wrapping up the layout tonight/tomorrow and should be ready to start printing them by week's end (a few days earlier than originally expected).  Now, we need to find out how many to run.<P>Post here (or email me directly -    <A HREF="mailto:Fiero87EC5@aol.com">Fiero87EC5@aol.com</A>   ) and let me know how many you want.  Also, send me:<P>- the name and address to which you wish to have the calendar(s) sent,<BR>- method of payment that you'll be using (we'll take check, money order or PayPal), and<BR>- desired method of shipment.  If you stick with standard mail, we'll include that in the price of the calendar - $10.  If you want faster shipping (Priority Mail is now $3.40 for under 2 pounds - three calendars will ship in one PM envelope), we'll add that on.<P>Finally, payment information is as follows:<P>For payments via PayPal, our account is:  <B>haas517@aol.com</B><BR>For check or money orders, send via snail mail to:<P><B>Scott Haas<BR>320 West Market Street<BR>Springboro, Ohio 45066</B><P>If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to email me directly.<P>Thanks to Cliff Pennock for the use of this forum and thanks to all of you for your support and contributions.  This will be the third year we've done this calendar - it couldn't happen without all of you!<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||6
